flowchart TD
  C[Create smith and name/class three heroes] --> M[Mine seams and trade in Open workings]
  M --> F[Craft training or standard gear; gain mastery]
  F --> S[Automatically stock displays lowest quality first]
  S --> B[Heroes browse compatible upgrades]
  B --> Q[Short travel; two rounds; front protects back]
  Q --> W{Victory?}
  W -->|Yes| P[One progress count per party member; rewards once]
  W -->|No| R[Return, rest, shop and retry]
  R --> B
  P --> G{20 counts?}
  G -->|No| B
  G -->|Yes| N[Next ordinary quest or boss approach]
  N --> H[Gather selected party; launch three-round boss]
  H --> T[Boss victory opens next tier]
  T --> M
  T --> L{Tier 5 boss defeated?}
  L -->|Yes| X[Optional Legacy: talents, furnishings, records, heirloom]
  X --> C
  F --> E[Employees gain XP and lose stamina]
  E --> O[Give time off; recover; manually resume]
  O --> F
